# One-time setup: GitHub repo -> Settings -> Secrets and variables -> Actions
# Create secret: HOSTINGER_SSH_KEY
#
# Paste the FULL private key contents (including BEGIN/END lines, no extra quotes).
# On Windows, the working deploy key is typically:
#   C:\Users\<you>\.ssh\hostinger_juninventory_deploy
#
# The matching public key must be in Hostinger ~/.ssh/authorized_keys.
# Test locally before saving the secret:
#   ssh -i ~/.ssh/hostinger_juninventory_deploy -p 65002 u899628465@109.106.254.155 "echo ok"
#
# After updating the secret, re-run "Deploy to Hostinger" from GitHub Actions.
